        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149445,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hai appena imparato perché è importante usare i tag HTML appropriati o, se non puoi usarli, i ruoli ARIA appropriati.</p><p>Impariamo a conoscere un altro attributo e a usare correttamente gli attributi ARIA.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149446,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A volte includiamo contenuti decorativi nell'HUD di un gioco che distraggono i lettori dello schermo. In questi casi, possiamo usare l'attributo <code>aria-hidden</code>.</p><p>Nasconde il contenuto dalle tecnologie assistive, ma continua ad apparire nella pagina.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"47\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"aria-hidden\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Animated sparkles effect around the scoreboard.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>aria-hidden</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149447,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>aria-hidden</code> indica agli screen reader di ignorare un elemento e il suo contenuto.</p><p>Non aggiungere <code>aria-hidden</code> a controlli interattivi come pulsanti o link, altrimenti gli utenti potrebbero non riuscire a usarli.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"49\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"aria-hidden\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"A flashy background animation behind the level select.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   It should be hidden for screen readers.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>aria-hidden</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149448,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dobbiamo assicurarci di usare i ruoli ARIA quando ne abbiamo bisogno.</p><p>Per esempio, questo ruolo <code>\"banner\"</code> interferisce con lo scopo reale di <code>ul</code>, che è mostrare un elenco. Quindi non dovremmo inserirlo qui.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"ul\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;banner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"li\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;#&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Start Game\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"li\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"li\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;#&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Options\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"li\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"ul\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149449,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando scriviamo il tag semantico per un elemento, non abbiamo bisogno dell'attributo <code>role</code>. Che cosa c'è di sbagliato in questo codice?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;button&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Start level\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Non è necessario l'attributo <code>role</code> in un elemento <code>button</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non ci serve il tag <code>button</code> in un elemento <code>button</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Non è necessario l'attributo <code>role</code> in un elemento <code>button</code>.</p></body></html>"
